      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Adapters \u2014 production target\n\n\u2022 PostgreSQL: ACID ledger\n  primary + read replicas\n\u2022 Redis: sessions, idempotency keys,\n  read cache\n\u2022 Payments / ledger service\n\u2022 Observability (logs, traces)",
      "originalText": "Adapters \u2014 production target\n\n\u2022 PostgreSQL: ACID ledger\n  primary + read replicas\n\u2022 Redis: sessions, idempotency keys,\n  read cache\n\u2022 Payments / ledger service\n\u2022 Observability (logs, traces)",
